# Admin > Compliance hub. These are configurable controls; whether a configuration meets a given law is for the operator to decide.

admin-nav-compliance = Compliance
compliance-title = Compliance
compliance-intro = Data-protection controls in one place: data requests, cookie consent, retention and the records you keep. Each tab describes what can be configured; whether a configuration meets a given law is for the operator to decide.

compliance-card-data-requests = Export and erase a user's data on request, with a record of each request.
compliance-card-cookies = Cookie inventory, categories, consent banner and consent log.
compliance-card-retention = How long each store keeps data, the daily sweep and log rotation.

